      "observed_at": "2026-10-25T00:00:00Z",
      "raw_utf8": "Kubernetes Deployment Rollback: To undo a rollout and return to the previous revision, run kubectl rollout undo deployment. Deployments manage ReplicaSets for declarative pod updates.",
